<h1>About EverydayToolsHQ</h1>

<p><strong>EverydayToolsHQ</strong> is a growing collection of simple, practical online tools designed to help you make everyday decisions faster and easier.</p>

<p>From finding toys to checking sunlight times, our tools turn everyday questions into instant answers.</p>

<h2>What We Do</h2>
<ul>
<li>Fast and simple online tools</li>
<li>Designed for real-life decisions</li>
<li>No complexity, just answers</li>
</ul>

<h2>Why We Exist</h2>
<p>We built EverydayToolsHQ to remove friction from everyday decision-making by combining useful tools in one place.</p>

